Package: aoe2r
Title: Data Access for Age of Empires II: Definitive Edition
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Jordano", "Zdanski", , "jordano.zdanski@acad.ufsm.br", role = c("aut", "cre"))
  )
Description: Downloads leaderboard, player profile and match history data from
    the online services backend used by the Age of Empires II: Definitive Edition
    game client. Functions return tibbles so results can be fed directly into
    data analysis and modelling workflows in R. Raw responses are used as
    offline fixtures so the parsing logic can be tested without network access.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends:
    R (>= 4.1)
Imports:
    httr,
    jsonlite,
    tibble
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
URL: https://github.com/JordanoZdanski/aoe2r
BugReports: https://github.com/JordanoZdanski/aoe2r/issues
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.1
